OL,3,GNEWSA#1m fraud builder enjoyed 'lavish'
OL,4,ALas Vegas spree
OL,5,
OL,6,FA builder who spent thousands of pounds
OL,7,Ffrom his #1m VAT scam on a "lavish"
OL,8,Fspree in Las Vegas has been jailed for
OL,9,Falmost seven years.
OL,11,FGary Briggs, 52, already had a history
OL,12,Fof fraud when he set up two companies
OL,13,Fin a bid to falsely get money out of
OL,14,FHMRC in 2019 and 2020, Newcastle Crown
OL,15,FCourt heard.
OL,17,FAs well as going on gambling
OL,18,Fexpeditions and buying expensive
OL,19,Fwatches and cars, he also laundered
OL,20,Falmost #70,000 through the bank
OL,21,Faccounts of three close relatives.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
