OL,3,GNEWSA#1m fraud builder enjoyed 'lavish'
OL,4,ALas Vegas spree
OL,5,
OL,6,FBriggs, from Hartlepool, had initially
OL,7,Fdenied wrongdoing but admitted cheating
OL,8,Fthe public revenue and money laundering
OL,9,Fafter his trial had begun. Judge Gavin
OL,10,FDoig said Briggs had been stealing from
OL,11,F"all of us in this country".
